+  - `go mod tidy`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/metering -run TestDeploymentUsageEmitter -count=1` (first red run failed on missing emitter/resource keys; green after implementation)
+  - `go test ./...` (first full run exposed the quota resource lockstep guard; green after updating it)
+  - `go test -race ./...`
+  - `go vet ./...`
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/...`
